    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="57598bb4-d778-5db4-bac1-b1d27e433938" activityNameId="aa5baa78-3c84-533d-ba3d-ebcc2e54f895" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Grass from natural meadow extensive organic, at field</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Grass from natural meadow extensive organic, at field
Refers to 1 kg dry matter of fresh gras from intensive organic production with 1.66 kg CO2  and 18.9 MJ per kg dry matter. The dry matter content of fresh gras is about 10-15%;
UUID: ee49c91f-90ad-3bdf-b598-7848938dff41
The inventories include the cultivation of gras on a permanent extensiv meadow. Included steps are application of Asulam against Rumex, harvest and  loading for transport.
Location: Refers to a production in the Swiss plateau (lowlands &lt;700m).
Technology: Extenisv organic production.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services and expert knowledge. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ee49c91f-90ad-3bdf-b598-7848938dff41.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
